  "question": {
    "text": "Two coaxial solenoids are made by winding thin insulated wire over a pipe of cross sectional area $A=$ $10 \\mathrm{~cm}^2$ and length $=20 \\mathrm{~cm}$. If one of the solenoids has 300 turns and the other 400 turns, their mutual inductance is $\\left(\\mu_0=4 \\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\mathrm{Tm} \\mathrm{A}^{-1}\\right)$",
    "image": null
  },
